pcf version=2
* control data keyword
pestmode                                 estimation
noptmax                                 5
svdmode                                 1
maxsing                          10000000
eigthresh                           1e-06
eigwrite                                1
ies_num_reals                  60
save_binary                    true
panther_agent_freeze_on_fail   false
ies_multimodal_alpha           0.99
ies_init_lam                   -100
ies_phi_factor_file            phi_facs.csv
ies_par_en                     prior.jcb
ies_obs_en                     noise.jcb
* parameter groups external
ar01.pargp_data.csv
* parameter data external
ar01.par_data.csv
* observation data external
ar01.obs_data.csv
* model command line
python forward_run.py
* model input external
ar01.tplfile_data.csv
* model output external
ar01.insfile_data.csv
